kite","letter":"L134","kind":"order","to":"kite-cav-1","path":["kite-camp","north-village","n-mid"],"depart":2100,"plain":"HORSE, WATCH THE ROADS AT MIDDLE FORD.","cipher":"DKQRN, WTSLD SDN QKTOR TS IEOOHN BKQO."},{"seq":391,"t":1800,"type":"model","house":"orchid","model":"local:local","tokens":1841,"retries":0},{"seq":392,"t":1800,"type":"thought","house":"orchid","text":"It is Watch 7. Doctrine: Take F2, hold it. I have units near S-mid (F2). Enemies are clustered at S-mid. I must act on enemy mail. Captured Tiger letters suggest troop movements around S-mid/S-west. I will reinforce F2 and prepare to act on the captured letters, focusing on the m"},{"seq":393,"t":1800,"type":"courier","id":"c112","house":"orchid","letter":"L135","kind":"order","to":"orchid-inf-1","path":["orchid-camp","south-village","s-mid"],"depart":2100,"plain":"FIRST FOOT, MARCH TO SOUTH BANK MIDDLE.","cipher":"AEQRT AKKT, IBQOD TK RKUTD LBJG IESSHM."},{"seq":394,"t":1800,"type":"courier","id":"c113","house":"orchid","letter":"L136","kind":"order","to":"orchid-arch-1","path":["orchid-camp","south-village"],"depart":2100,"plain":"BOWMEN, HOLD AT MIDDLE FORD.","cipher":"LKWIMJ, DKHS BT IESSHM AKQS."},{"seq":395,"t":1800,"type":"courier","id":"c114","house":"orchid","letter":"L137","kind":"order","to":"orchid-cav-1","path":["orchid-camp","south-village","s-mid"],"depart":2100,"plain":"HORSE, MARCH TO MIDDLE FORD.","cipher":"DKQRM, IBQOD TK IESSHM AKQS."},{"seq":396,"t":1800,"type":"model","house":"tiger","model":"local:local","tokens":1600,"retries":0},{"seq":397,"t":1800,"type":"thought","house":"tiger","text":"It is Watch 7. My doctrine demands taking the middle ford (F2) early. I need to move my forces towards F2/s-mid/n-mid. I will use the two riders method for important orders. Since I have no immediate intel, I will move forces to secure F2."},{"seq":398,"t":1800,"type":"courier","id":"c115","house":"tiger","letter":"L138","kind":"order","to":"tiger-inf-1","path":["tiger-camp","south-villa